From 93f4685daf78de768662e1a23b240f3a6147947c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 9 Jul 2026 05:38:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Redesign site with refined editorial direction

- Typography: self-hosted Fraunces (display) + Figtree (body) via
  next/font, replacing Typekit + Google CSS imports
- Sticky nav with react-scroll spy links, absorbing the Styles
  version switcher as a popover
- Splash: lower-third composition with oversized display title,
  left-aligned rotating tagline, minimal scroll cue
- Background: slow-drifting corner-anchored gradient blobs
  (CSS-only, reuses BALL_COLORS), renamed framerBG -> background
- Projects: numbered editorial index rows with hairlines replacing
  alternating cards; GitHub entry becomes an outro link
- About: asymmetric grid with bio lede pull-out and ghost chips
- Contact: single-column underline-input form, normal-sized submit
- Split stylesheet.js into per-section style files + shared.tsx
- Fix resume href case (/Resume.png) and tagline clearInterval bug

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CFWAhZXn31TB9Bzz86CDzC
